/*
  Multimatic Motorsports Watch
  Hardware: Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.06
  Display:  410x502 CO5300 QSPI AMOLED
  Touch:    FT3168
  Framework: Arduino-ESP32 3.3.x
  UI: LVGL 9.x

  V0.9.58 TEST BUILD - OTA IMAGE VERSION VERIFICATION
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  - Motorsport-only UI
  - HOME desktop with shortcuts
  - Rounded-display safe-area layout
  - Scrollable Vehicle Vitals
  - Engine / extended vitals page
  - Live BF1 Type-73 BLE radar / decoder test
  - Session page
  - Custom Multimatic-inspired home icons
  - Crew page placeholder
  - Touch navigation
  - AMOLED black visual theme
  - ES8311 onboard speaker / I2S audio subsystem initialized

  Vehicle CAN values remain simulated.
  BF1 RADAR is LIVE in this test build and reuses the proven
  Type-73 manufacturer-data decode used by Multimatic TPMS Pro.

  Base display/touch initialization follows Waveshare's
  ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.06 LVGL Arduino v9 example.
*/

